{
  "_comment": [
    "What a caller asks, and a token that must appear in the answer.",
    "",
    "Run with: BLAND_API_KEY=… node scripts/test-knowledge.mjs",
    "",
    "These run against Bland's own retrieval, in the caller's words, and cost",
    "NOTHING: verified by measuring the account balance across ten queries.",
    "So there is no reason not to run the whole suite on every knowledge change.",
    "",
    "This exists because retrieval, not content, is what fails. The ceiling height",
    "was published, correct, and in its own chunk, and the agent still told a real",
    "caller it did not know: 'How high are the ceilings?' matched nothing while",
    "'43 feet' matched perfectly. A fact the agent cannot retrieve is a fact it",
    "does not have.",
    "",
    "expect: any ONE of these substrings, case insensitive, is a pass. Keep them",
    "short and factual so a rewording of the answer does not fail the test."
  ],
